**Drawn:** a generic `yotsumeAnchor` class block (silence draws nothing) — square-bar shank split into four recurved claws, elongated head ring with the free accessory ring the cable bends to, 2.0 m corpus default (~120 kg, a direct-pull load for a crew with no winch), stowed recovered on the foredeck, cable flaked in a coil beside the head. Every unrecorded dimension named as a default in the provenance and on the card.

