Live stamp verified: **1788416833** — the deploy landed. Round 207 is complete.

## What this round did

**Paid residual 25.** The full 64-frame ratchet ran whole on the untouched tree at open — all 64 within tolerance, zero accepts, FRAME-LOG untouched. Worst mover was globe-default at its documented 0.046% flap, a seventh round at the same figure. Two full runs don't fit the wrapper's 80-minute kill, so the round took the r204 shape: no rendered change, close attributed to the opening run (git status at close showed only loop.log, the daemon's cookie file, and r207 staging).

**Answered the datum question — and it changes what the Beam row means.** I fetched the card's own primary cite, Hong Sun-jae 2025 (군사 135), whole from KCI (the bare curl gets a block page; browser headers work). His 표 5 estimates the Imjin-era flagship at 본판 70척, 상갑판장 103척, 상장요광 30척 — and at the 영조척 those last two are 32.1 m and ~9.4 m. The card's 32/9.4 are the **fighting deck's** length and waist breadth, not the hull shell's. The record's own structure (김재근, quoted by Hong) puts the deck 5–6척 wider than the hull sides on the projecting 가목 ends — so the model's shell, drawn at 9.4 m, is about 1.9 m too beamy, and its 0.5 m deck overhang is half the record's. That fix and the row amendment are staged for r208 to land together, measured before and after.

**Answered the foot question.** The 1882 register names no foot, but it keeps the 도설's: the 귀선's 본판 67척 vs the 1795 도설's 64자8치 within 3.4%, and its 일전선 is the 각선도본 전선 within 촌s — one foot across a century of the yard's records. Hong's own text converts at 척 ≈ 30 cm, and the institute's 재현선 headline (32.16 m) is exactly 105척 at 30.63 cm. The drafted row prints both conversions and carries the contest, like the 1795 row.

**Staged for r208:** the 1882 row drafted verbatim in `build/staging/r207/JUDGMENT.md`, plus the coupled geometry fix. 만기요람 was read and closed (narrative only, no dimensions). One new fetch candidate named: the 2021 판옥선 학술연구 보고서, which alone can resolve why the 재현선's 8.74 m beam matches no single record breadth.

**Gates:** audit 33/0 · build stamped 1788416833 · both pushes' receipts read in-round · live stamp confirmed. The 본문편 daemon is on attempt 2 (~166 MB when last checked) and was left alone per the standing instruction.

